      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "\"Unit 402 is the apotheosis of luxury living, a masterclass in opulence that redefines the very fabric of HighRise sophistication. This sumptuous retreat boasts 5,000 square feet of unadulterated bliss, with 10-foot ceilings, floor-to-ceiling windows that frame the city skyline, and a private balcony that's the epitome of al fresco living. The pièce de résistance, however, is the bespoke, 1,000-bottle wine cellar, expertly crafted to showcase the world's finest vintages in a temperature-controlled haven. Every detail, from the hand-finished hardwood floors to the custom, 10-foot-long marble waterfall in the master bathroom, has been meticulously curated to create an unparalleled sense of refinement and exclusivity. This is not just a home – it's an experience, a symphony of luxury that will leave even the most discerning connoisseur breathless.\"",
      "source": "target",
